Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}45-second reaction arcade for event booths.\N45 秒反应街机，为现场摊位快速轮换而设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Edited only from the supplied demo, screenshots and evidence.\N仅使用已有 Demo、截图与证据剪辑；未补录新游戏结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Start with one click or tap.\N点击或轻触即可开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}No login, installation or API key.\N无需登录、安装或 API Key。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Every run is 45 seconds; results appear immediately.\N每局固定 45 秒，结算即时可见。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Catch cyan signals; collect blue bonuses; avoid red noise.\N接住青色信号，收集蓝色奖励，避开红色噪声。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}The supplied demo shows the actual game screen and HUD.\N已有 Demo 展示真实游戏画面与 HUD。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Sustained streaks unlock 1.5x, 2x, 3x and 4x.\N连续命中逐步解锁 1.5、2、3、4 倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Misses subtract 25; noise subtracts 75.\N空点扣 25 分，噪声扣 75 分。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Short rounds keep booth lines moving.\N短局循环让摊位排队持续流动。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Score, grade, accuracy, best streak and local rank.\N等级、分数、准确率、最佳连击与本地排名一次呈现。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}This supplied demo run scored 000600 with 100% accuracy.\N已有 Demo 该局分数 000600，准确率 100%。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}One click returns to the next run.\N一键再来，立即开始下一局。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Top ten runs stay on this device.\N本地前十保存在同一设备。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}No account, server or Wi-Fi is required.\N无需账号、服务器或 Wi-Fi。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}A separate display mirrors the local leaderboard.\N独立屏幕实时镜像本地排行榜。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Booth mode is designed to reset 15 seconds after a run.\NBooth 模式在每局结束后 15 秒自动重置。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}The countdown pauses while the leaderboard is open.\N打开排行榜时，倒计时暂停。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}One device can run play and display together.\N同一设备可同时运行游戏与排行榜显示。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}This is a local board, not a cross-device network ranking.\N排行榜仅限本机，并非跨设备网络排行榜。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Arrow keys select; Space or Enter locks a target.\N方向键选择，空格或回车锁定。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}P or Escape pauses; M toggles sound.\NP 或 Esc 暂停，M 切换声音。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Reduced motion, focus, contrast and live status are included.\N提供减少动态、可见焦点、高对比与状态播报。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}A deterministic core owns scoring, timing and round state.\N确定性核心统一管理计分、计时与回合状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Rendering, audio, input and storage stay separate.\N渲染、音频、输入与存储保持分离。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:02:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Project inspected with IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3.\N项目使用 IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3 检查。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}The IDE found a CSS variable and two lifecycle promises.\NIDE 发现 CSS 变量与两个生命周期 Promise 问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Both issue types were fixed; final source findings: 0.\N两类问题均已修复；最终源码问题为 0。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Environment warnings are listed separately, not counted as source findings.\N环境警告单独注明，不计为源码问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}All 26 Node tests passed in this assembly run.\N本次剪辑时运行 Node 测试，26 项全部通过。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Coverage includes input, scoring, pause, persistence and corrupt storage.\N覆盖输入、计分、暂停、持久化与损坏存储。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Includes a 100-round booth reset stress test.\N包含 100 局 Booth 连续重置压力测试。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}After first load, the app shell supports offline reload.\N首次加载后，应用外壳支持离线重载。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Artwork and sound are original; no external assets or trackers.\N图形与音效均为原创，无外部素材或追踪器。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}MIT licensed and documented for local startup.\N采用 MIT 许可，附本地启动说明。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Simple controls. Short rounds. High-score rematches.\N简单操作，短局循环，高分复玩。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Run instructions and evidence are in the submission package.\N启动说明与完整证据均在提交包中。
